Bounded Unreal 5.8 C++ implementation assistance. APawn (not ACharacter) uses FloatingPawnMovement for player and AddActorWorldOffset sweep for NPCs. Preserve gameplay/collision. Need native AnimInstanceProxy pose graph: directional speed BlendSpace, gameplay-owned jump time curve 0.8s, damage action, dead/dormant/seated cancellation. Installed Epic Manny Simple and template rifle/unarmed sequences available. Suggest robust small graph and state sampling, native API names, and pitfalls (worker thread access, teleport speed, asset dependency closure). No authority or completion decisions. Max 10 concise bullets.
